I'm making the hamburger, man.

818
00:47:11,572 --> 00:47:14,272
Oh my!

819
00:47:15,072 --> 00:47:18,072
流していい？
Can I pour it down?

820
00:47:19,572 --> 00:47:22,572
ダメ？頑張れ！
No? Good luck!

821
00:47:24,072 --> 00:47:26,072
どう？
How is it?

822
00:47:26,072 --> 00:47:27,872
おいしい！よかった！
Delicious! I'm glad!

823
00:47:28,072 --> 00:47:30,572
すごい美味しいね！おかわり！
It's super tasty! Seconds, please!

824
00:47:32,072 --> 00:47:35,072
いけるかはじめ？
Can you do it, Hajime?

825
00:47:35,072 --> 00:47:38,272
はじめはいまね... やってみよう！
Hajime is currently... Let me try!

826
00:47:39,072 --> 00:47:42,572
モサモサしたやつが光るやつ
The fluffy ones are the glowing ones.

827
00:47:42,572 --> 00:47:45,072
もっちゃん、もっちゃん
Mocchan, Mocchan.

828
00:47:47,872 --> 00:47:51,572
おお！すごい！
Whoa! Amazing!

829
00:47:53,072 --> 00:47:56,072
ナイス！ナイスー！
Nice! Nice!

830
00:47:56,572 --> 00:47:59,272
