Now, now, now...

982
00:56:30,088 --> 00:56:32,288
ごちそうさまでした！美味しかった！
Thank you for the meal! It was delicious!

983
00:56:32,588 --> 00:56:35,088
棒の味... 棒の味ちょっきい...
Tasted like stick... A little taste of stick...

984
00:56:36,588 --> 00:56:39,088
うわぁー！ リアル...
Uwaaa! Real...

985
